  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add lamb shanks and brown on all sides for about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove shanks and set aside.",
    "In the same pot, sauté chopped onion and minced garlic until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in sliced carrot and cubed potato, cooking for another 5 minutes.",
    "Add diced tomatoes, cumin, paprika, and salt, and stir to coat vegetables.",
    "Return lamb shanks to the pot, pour in water or stock, and add bay leaves.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer, reduce heat to low, cover, and cook for 2 hours until lamb is tender.",
    "Remove bay leaves, adjust seasoning, and serve hot with leaf-wrap steam."
